      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Definitely a priority, at any rate. Useful for many laptop users and VR users alike for performance legroom. Honestly, even a more in-depth settings menu in-game to be able to tweak compromises for CPU performance would be beautiful here. Not many options.\n\nWould love to be able to do more in the background, really. At the time being, as it comes to me, I can't run much of anything useful without some this-game-specific Oculus tracking stuttering (8th-Gen i7, GTX970, 0.8 Supersample). It's an interesting issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
