      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also I noticed in last versions of VRC it's (almost) eating one CPU core even if you alone with simple avatar in empty lag-free world w/o physical objects, TVs, etc that can use CPU. That strange if you put game in minimal load conditions and game still consumes a lot resources. In mar-apr I was able to afk in vrc w/o loading pc very hard, but today it's problematic.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
