        "like": 6
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This game is still the only Vr game i can talk about with EVERYONE that is so frustrated on how it is so UN-OPTIMIZED. Even with optimized avatars!\nI can play any other Vr game that is triple its intensity and still run the game twice as better than vrchat can run in a world with less than 6 people in it. its an absolute joke and is really embarrassing that no amount of hardware can fix it.\nTo then figure out vrchat is cpu bound and only uses 1 core.... 1 CORE!\nWhy not allow the game to support hyper threading and actually use ur computer the way its suppose too instead of it running like a restricted console platform.\nWell Unity 2019 supports hyper threading and can honestly solve so many problems.\nI believe that vrchat could really be the future and one of the major draw backs of this game is its performance. people getting sick in vr cause of how laggy it can get and crashers in game is getting old and ridiculous. pls fix this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
