      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{605e2382939eb91834910881|full_name}: VRChat is already multithreaded, Unity 2019 isn't going to change that aside from making *Unity* functions better threaded.\nVRC's overhead is roughly 0.9ms; if you're lagging, it's the avatars and world around you, and there's a lot you can do to mitigate that!",
