      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I get great framerates when I'm all alone. Though when the room starts filling up with people, the FPS drops no matter how optimized their avatars are. Hell, even hiding everyone's avatars so they're just grey robots still drops my framerate considerably.",
      "viewerReactions": null
